## Story Description
Create supabase/migrations/003_data_model_hardening.sql. This migration enables the pgvector extension, creates the ingestion_batches and transactions_raw staging tables, creates description_embeddings and supplier_embeddings tables with VECTOR(384) columns and IVFFlat indexes, adds a source_raw_id UUID column to the existing transactions table, and applies RLS policies to all new tables following the existing pattern from 001_initial_schema.sql.

## Acceptance Criteria
- Create file: supabase/migrations/003_data_model_hardening.sql
- File contains: CREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS vector
- File creates table ingestion_batches with columns: id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(), engagement_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES engagements(id) ON DELETE CASCADE, filename TEXT NOT NULL, row_count INTEGER, new_rows INTEGER, duplicate_rows INTEGER, status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'processing', uploaded_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(), completed_at TIMESTAMPTZ
- File creates table transactions_raw with columns: id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(), engagement_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES engagements(id) ON DELETE CASCADE, batch_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES ingestion_batches(id) ON DELETE CASCADE, source_row_hash TEXT NOT NULL, pipeline_status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'queued', invoice_number TEXT, invoice_date TEXT, raw_supplier_name TEXT, base_amount DOUBLE PRECISION, raw_data JSONB, created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()
- File creates: CREATE UNIQUE INDEX ON transactions_raw(engagement_id, source_row_hash)
- File creates table description_embeddings with columns: id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(), normalised_text TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE, embedding VECTOR(384) NOT NULL, model_name TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'all-MiniLM-L6-v2', created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()
- File creates table supplier_embeddings with columns: id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(), engagement_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES engagements(id) ON DELETE CASCADE, normalised_name TEXT NOT NULL, embedding VECTOR(384) NOT NULL, model_name TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'all-MiniLM-L6-v2', created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(), UNIQUE(engagement_id, normalised_name)
- File creates IVFFlat indexes: CREATE INDEX ON description_embeddings USING ivfflat (embedding vector_cosine_ops) WITH (lists = 50) and same pattern for supplier_embeddings
- File adds: ALTER TABLE transactions ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS source_raw_id UUID REFERENCES transactions_raw(id)
- File adds: ALTER TABLE pipeline_jobs ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS batch_id UUID REFERENCES ingestion_batches(id)
- File enables RLS on ingestion_batches, transactions_raw, supplier_embeddings with SELECT/INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE policies matching the pattern in 001_initial_schema.sql
- Verify: grep -c 'CREATE TABLE' supabase/migrations/003_data_model_hardening.sql returns 4

